# local env files
# `.env` itself was NOT ignored here, only `.env*.local` — so the moment the
# file held anything it would have been committed. It now carries the API URL
# and will carry more. (G-07 in PLAN.md.)
.env
.env*.local
# ...but the template is meant to be committed.
!.env.example

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo

app-example

# generated native folders
/ios
/android
